<title>UK: GECC sets 1.5 billion FFR 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>GECC sets 1.5 billion FFR 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL ELECTRIC CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    20.AUG.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.807    PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    99.807    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
</text>
